      <item>
        <title>Pinned: Global expansion: accelerating Attempt to kill crypto: exposed Sovereign wealth tokenizing on @Base: $600B worth Bitcoin’s quantum defense: assembling Emmy nomination: 1 Mini Cooper up for grabs: also 1 Here&apos;s everything that happened @Coinbase in July ↓</title>
        <dc:creator>@coinbase</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>Global expansion: accelerating<br>
Attempt to kill crypto: exposed<br>
Sovereign wealth tokenizing on <a href="https://nitter.net/base" title="Base">@Base</a>: $600B worth<br>
Bitcoin’s quantum defense: assembling<br>
Emmy nomination: 1<br>
Mini Cooper up for grabs: also 1<br>
<br>
Here's everything that happened <a href="https://nitter.net/coinbase" title="Coinbase 🛡️">@Coinbase</a> in July ↓</p>
<hr/>
<b>Article</b><br>
<a href="https://nitter.net/i/article/2083561753296675276">
<img src="https://nitter.net/pic/media%2FHOpKDdIXoAAd2UB.jpg" style="max-width:250px;" />
<br>
<b>Stablecoins, Agentic Markets, and a Win for Crypto: July @Coinbase</b>
</a>
<p>Crypto spent years proving it deserved a place in the financial system.
This month offered a glimpse of what comes next: that system rebuilding itself on crypto rails.
Stablecoins became more useful</p>]]></description>
