      <item>
        <title>ICYMI: you can now tell your agent to &quot;buy ETH if it dips 5%&quot; and go touch grass. Character growth, honestly.</title>
        <dc:creator>@coinbase</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>ICYMI: you can now tell your agent to "buy ETH if it dips 5%" and go touch grass.<br>
<br>
Character growth, honestly.</p>
<hr/>
<blockquote>
<b>Coinbase 🛡️ (@coinbase)</b>
<p>
<hr/>
<b>Article</b><br>
<a href="https://nitter.net/i/article/2080322207645863979">
<img src="https://nitter.net/pic/media%2FHN7HmvXXMAA5MjY.jpg" style="max-width:250px;" />
<br>
<b>Building For Every Side of the Agentic Economy</b>
</a>
<p>Last month, agentic traffic surpassed human traffic on our Base documentation pages for the first time. We believe agents are going to become the main way we access and navigate the internet across</p>


</p>
<footer>
— <cite><a href="https://nitter.net/coinbase/status/2080322207645863979#m">https://nitter.net/coinbase/status/2080322207645863979#m</a>
</footer>
</blockquote>]]></description>
        <pubDate>Sun, 26 Jul 2026 14:10:54 GMT</pubDate>
        <guid isPermaLink="false">2081381753894449498</guid>
        <link>https://nitter.net/coinbase/status/2081381753894449498#m</link>
      </item>
      <item>
        <title>R to @coinbase: You can sign up for Coinbase Business today at http://coinbase.com/business</title>
        <dc:creator>@coinbase</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>You can sign up for Coinbase Business today at <a href="http://coinbase.com/business">coinbase.com/business</a></p>
<hr/>
<b>Link</b><br>
<a href="http://coinbase.com/business">
<img src="https://nitter.net/pic/card_img%2F2079199246457483264%2FT1qXRe5W%3Fformat%3Dpng%26name%3D800x419" style="max-width:250px;" />
<br>
<b>Coinbase Business | Crypto Payments, Trading &amp; Custody</b>
</a>
<p>Coinbase Business is an all-in-one crypto financial platform for businesses to accept and send payments globally, trade, and securely store digital assets.</p>
<small><a href="http://coinbase.com/business">coinbase.com</a></small>

<hr/>
<blockquote>
<b>Brian Armstrong (@brian_armstrong)</b>
<p>
<p>Coinbase Business is growing nicely - all from word of mouth with no marketing - helping companies engage in more efficient payments, trading, treasury management, bill pay, and more.<br>
<br>
Turns out small and medium sized businesses need an update to the financial system as well. It has a MCP API as well to support agentic finance.<br>
<br>
Nice work <a href="https://nitter.net/sid_coelho" title="Sid Coelho-Prabhu | sidcoin.eth 🛡️">@sid_coelho</a> and team!<br>
<br>
Sign up for Coinbase Business today (link in follow on post).</p>

</p>
<footer>
— <cite><a href="https://nitter.net/brian_armstrong/status/2080039295424049322#m">https://nitter.net/brian_armstrong/status/2080039295424049322#m</a>
</footer>
</blockquote>]]></description>
        <pubDate>Sun, 26 Jul 2026 14:11:06 GMT</pubDate>
        <guid isPermaLink="false">2081381801814380744</guid>
        <link>https://nitter.net/coinbase/status/2081381801814380744#m</link>
      </item>
